{
 "batchId": "b-0229",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_4d8b3bb4623d0f10b222",
   "sourceHash": "4d8b3bb4623d0f10b2228893ec945ece4c100fd8fa1cbffe005cf4fc9b4a8c1a",
   "text": "您将接受一套全面的正统阿育吠陀治疗项目，旨在实现身、心、灵的和谐。由多位阿育吠陀医生组成的团队将评估您的健康状况，并为这一周制定最适合您的调养方案。方案可能包括Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）按摩（由两位治疗师同步、有节奏地涂抹草本油），或其他有针对性的疗法，例如滴油疗法（Dhaara），以帮助您达到良好的身心状态并恢复平衡。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4ca70181004796a6bc60",
   "sourceHash": "4ca70181004796a6bc605f66b0bcdc89fd3a49a437096d8364d2f3379f8021b5",
   "text": "我们的阿育吠陀课程以及参观Kairali阿育吠陀产品工厂，将帮助您初步了解阿育吠陀在当代生活中的应用。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_49bf562cfd019e42e91a",
   "sourceHash": "49bf562cfd019e42e91a17682bdb60f2564533ecbf89abd42b1a193d93fb1a37",
   "text": "在瑜伽垫上练习瑜伽的人们。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a87db4f683023d750633",
   "sourceHash": "a87db4f683023d7506338f3bb1e2b99319374e9ef6b9da76dfeb63555ea29efc",
   "text": "“瑜伽”一词源自梵语“yuj”，意为“连接”或“结合”。它是身、心、灵的和谐，也是个体自我与觉知之间的联结。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f0fbcd735ac917001b34",
   "sourceHash": "f0fbcd735ac917001b34fe3f24ee5be33b35a90ecc303ae73c4a8eb8bed4cc94",
   "text": "对于希望深入探索瑜伽的内涵、历史背景、基本原则及其在当代生活中意义的人来说，Kairali是理想之地。本次静修项目将为各个水平的学员提供工作坊，内容涵盖瑜伽哲学、吠檀多、梵语、坦陀罗和冥想。通过有意识地将这些原则融入生活，我们可以采取统一的方法，建立一种促进真正健康与长寿的生活方式。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_45cbefa4986a06919684",
   "sourceHash": "45cbefa4986a0691968452d1a2cf46e6f00af0c3d21c82f3b54cd5465d1ab9ac",
   "text": "瑜伽的哲学与智慧已有5,000多年历史，博大精深。在我们的工作坊中，我们将帮助您理解古老的哲学思想，并将其融入日常生活。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_32be014d9fb38c852455",
   "sourceHash": "32be014d9fb38c85245576e39f67405dea2f4ec297fdcc5372ab795e9d40e392",
   "text": "拓宽您对吠檀多、瑜伽哲学、昆达里尼、冥想、梵语和坦陀罗的理解。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d582f925d93e0ec207e3",
   "sourceHash": "d582f925d93e0ec207e32bc1c0b5c42e6f30cbed41c93061569f2face23a4ee6",
   "text": "每场工作坊都包括对各种观点的自由讨论与探究，并提供可在日常生活中实践的具体建议，帮助您将瑜伽更全面地融入日常作息。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a48ddceddd9e825eb28d",
   "sourceHash": "a48ddceddd9e825eb28d584b2ea05907509afefea0f89488e660cf1e2b095cbb",
   "text": "白天您将体验哪些活动？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1b565f1484da11402573",
   "sourceHash": "1b565f1484da11402573a9c5648ac0bb5e5fa40afe16aaa18d05920d878c2ac5",
   "text": "花园小径、黄铜碗、吊床和一本书的拼贴图。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_423c589eb0b4b5f207d2",
   "sourceHash": "423c589eb0b4b5f207d2584593a9dc725a3b3e97e5a50744599f3ec82bbabb52",
   "text": "典型的一天包括：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4679912504fa99bb0659",
   "sourceHash": "4679912504fa99bb06590f08379afef81a9362a9dc4b7e54fcd9dc062be1475c",
   "text": "日出冥想。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_73ef76e35a984b1bf0ea",
   "sourceHash": "73ef76e35a984b1bf0ea536d223f59a5afbb99a786d4007d64aa3c6516eb4692",
   "text": "Dina Chayra（晨间作息）——晨间阿育吠陀仪式，培养身心健康，为新的一天做好准备。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c27a734fc8a0f3232d0a",
   "sourceHash": "c27a734fc8a0f3232d0a01e00fc7be710c3982b89fece2b17296e6653d0ab972",
   "text": "Patanjali Smaran（帕坦伽利忆念）——以火供（yagna）的形式，在引导下向瑜伽传统的先贤表达感恩的练习。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_422262451a9fa9cd2c68",
   "sourceHash": "422262451a9fa9cd2c68215e0fa1dcbf34f3e1535ab2f65789bdfef7af1d34f8",
   "text": "一套旨在活动全身每一块肌肉的流瑜伽（Vinyasa）序列。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8dab3c942a9d5a1f45a0",
   "sourceHash": "8dab3c942a9d5a1f45a0e0db812de1f210b3db447a37a0bc1aa3768c6b149a57",
   "text": "瑜伽早餐。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_030620063b2927e1cd3f",
   "sourceHash": "030620063b2927e1cd3f657c6033d39dc00e1855aff2d539b7c0c71abe056ed1",
   "text": "阿育吠陀问诊，并配合按摩或治疗，例如旨在帮助身体排毒的阿比扬伽（abhyanga）按摩。所用药油由医生决定，均为从草药中提取的药用油，对健康有很大益处。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ba32b1cb77d3d5539889",
   "sourceHash": "ba32b1cb77d3d55398898915b7a370b9e85922228c114cbcef232fabd9ce31d4",
   "text": "瑜伽午餐",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_edeb479d0e41669781dd",
   "sourceHash": "edeb479d0e41669781ddbeff4933c3bcaadf5ac7bc595e46426a64f6c32595d1",
   "text": "自由时间",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2013389a3a9f3ace346c",
   "sourceHash": "2013389a3a9f3ace346c41fb709435f03ab8ff0e2aefcfbfb5f6539b8ade45b2",
   "text": "瑜伽经典原典工作坊",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2f87c627264cc8643fd5",
   "sourceHash": "2f87c627264cc8643fd5e5041d6d3e3ed21327772b1abc7cf15d17d2503cdf32",
   "text": "Rejuv Yoga——一套旨在焕活经脉（nadis）的特色瑜伽序列。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_321a87583efbf81f2c1f",
   "sourceHash": "321a87583efbf81f2c1f2b332f32a76b79cf6222db61fbc71fa577abb07302a3",
   "text": "黄昏祈祷",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4079e6e274150267bbad",
   "sourceHash": "4079e6e274150267bbad2a081e6fe10cf76064e367879b069a584447a1dc5be5",
   "text": "集体晚餐",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dec5a91b04f8dc2322ac",
   "sourceHash": "dec5a91b04f8dc2322ace3618bc298607ce2b40504756a28e37efe6985f8bd09",
   "text": "月光冥想 / 瑜伽休息术（Yoga Nidra）——瑜伽睡眠的艺术",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
